      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Schedule(s)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\n\nAmendment of the Datacasting Charge (Imposition) Act 1998  Schedule 1"
    },
