      "dc:source": "datacasting-charge-imposition-amendment-act-2000.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(b) the transmitter licence is held by the holder of a commercial\ntelevision broadcasting licence; and",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(b) the transmitter licence is held by the holder of a commercial\ntelevision broadcasting licence; and",
